Directory populated at runtime by platform/src/routes/domains.ts
(appendCaddyBlock) — one `custom-domains.caddy` file with a site block
per live paid-tier custom domain, plus a `.reload-requested` sentinel file
consumed by the cron in deploy/RUNBOOK.md section 8c. Bind-mounted into
the `platform` container by docker-compose.yml and imported by the box's
main Caddyfile (`import /opt/infra-box/stacks/vcpeer-book/deploy/custom-domains/*.caddy`).
Starts out empty, which is a valid/empty Caddy import — this file only
exists so the directory survives a fresh `git clone`.
